# QuickCart — Vercel root deploy is the Next.js app only.
# Everything below is either the Hostinger-VPS API, infra tooling, or docs
# that Vercel never needs to see. Keeping the upload small also keeps Hobby
# build times down.

# Express API — deployed separately to the Hostinger VPS, never to Vercel.
/server

# Supabase migrations/seed — applied via `supabase db push`, not a build input.
/supabase

# Manual/QA scripts — not part of the Next.js build.
/qa

# VPS/Nginx/PM2/CI infra files authored for the VPS + GitHub Actions, not Vercel.
/deploy

# Repo docs not needed at build time.
ORCHESTRATION.md
PROGRESS.md
README-SETUP.txt
CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
CONTRIBUTING.md

# Agent definitions — internal tooling only.
/.claude
